	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Etsi mihi<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">mihi <hi>vom Schreiber korrigiert aus</hi> enim.</note> dubium nunquam fuit, quin eo erga me absentem animo <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>adhuc esses, quem tu mihi saepe praestitisti, non potui tamen vehementer <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>non gaudere, cum illud idem literis tuis mihi significares<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Der Brief, in dem <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> <persName ref="p1214">Fries</persName> die Berufung an die Zürcher Fraumünsterschule mitteilte, ist nicht erhalten; vgl. aber oben <ref target="file11001">Nr. 959</ref>.</note>, patrone <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>longe omnium<pb type="edition" next="88"/> charissime.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ex quibus etiam tuam senatusque sententiam de <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>me abunde intellexi, cui paucis his verbis respondebo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nosti, mi <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, me tecum de rebus meis post meum ex <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>reditum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p1214">Fries</persName> hatte 1535 in <placeName ref="l378">Paris</placeName> den Magistergrad erworben und war spätestens Mitte 1536 von dort zurückgekehrt; vgl. <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10224">[Nr. 193]</ref>, S. 74, Anm. 1, und <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10882">[Nr. 843]</ref>, S. 329, 23-29.</note> saepe contulisse ac tuo consilio frequenter fuisse usum, quo <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>pacto meos creditores placare et in pacem redigere possem<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Zur Verschuldung von <persName ref="p1214">Fries</persName> vgl. oben <ref target="file11002">Nr. 960</ref>, 4-6.</note>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Nulla <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>prorsus alia via commodius inveniri potuit, quam ut rursus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>iter <placeName ref="l28">Basilęam</placeName>, unde digressus, instituerem istamque docendi <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cum<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> cum <hi>gestrichenes</hi> publice p[?].</note> publice tum privatim, quam nosti, provinciam apud <persName ref="p1365">Grynęum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>tanquam nostri collegii destitutus auxilio<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>vor</hi> auxilio <hi>gestrichenes</hi> consilio.</note> apertis, ut aiunt, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ulnis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. Adagia, 2, 9, 54 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 675).</note> subirem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Caeterum <persName ref="p1365">Grynęus</persName> meo delectatus reditu hanc ultro mihi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>obtulit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Accepi meamque fidem illi et toto gymnasio ad aliquod <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>temporis spatium dedi.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Cum ergo publico consensu clarisque in patriam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>revocer literis, turpe sane esse me tam honestę vocationi non <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>respondere quis non nisi insanus iudicet?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed quo ore quave <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>audacia accademiae <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensi</placeName>, quae mea nunc opera utitur nec <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>illa tam subito poterit carere, nisi alium, qui mihi succedat, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>substituat, renuntiare ausim, plane ignoro.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Didascalorum apud eos <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et fere passim magna est penuria; licet reperias facile eruditorum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>copiosum numerum, non tam<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e">tam <hi>wohl irrtümlich für</hi> tamen.</note> omnes apti et ad docendum idonei sunt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Tu igitur, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, hac de re, quaeso, delibera meque apud <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p1365">Grynęum</persName> diligenter excuses, ne ingratitudinis vitium incurrere videar.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Hoc quamprimum factum erit illeque veniam nobis discedendi concesserit, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sumptis Pegasaeis alis<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 271, Nr. 1374.</note> ad vos ocyssime advolabo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ad hunc fere <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>modum senatui scripsi<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Ein entsprechender Brief an den Zürcher Rat ist nicht erhalten.</note>, idque non meo, sed <persName ref="p1365">Grynęi</persName> nostri et <persName ref="p8418">Myconii</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>feci iussu.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Verum ne quid te lateat, hanc, ut vocant, copiam tibi <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>mittere volui.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Non aegre tulissem <persName ref="p1283">Conrado</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p1283">Konrad Geßner</persName>.</note> nostro hanc <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>fuisse oblatam conditionem; nam me magis opus haberet, cui etiam plus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>faveo quam mihi ipsi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Verum cum effectum esse diligentia et industria <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>tua senatusque consulto intelligam, lubens, quam primum tu senatusque consilium <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>inveneritis, quo modo honeste id fieri possit, vestro iussui parebo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>De <persName ref="p8465">Melchiore</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8465">Melchior Wirz</persName>; vgl. oben <ref target="file11002">Nr. 960</ref>, 15-20 mit Anm. 3.</note> nostro alias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Haec tibi tanquam summo studiosorum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>patrono volui breviter communicare.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Tu pro tua humanitate boni consule.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Si in hoc peccavi, factum imprudentia, non dolo esse existima.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb type="scan" next="||86v."/>Qu<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>a<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>eso, si grave non est, has literas, quas modo scripsi, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>et <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName> meo ad legendum exhibeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><pb type="edition" next="89"/>Vale, mi doctissime <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ac optime patrone.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Datum raptim, nonis martii 1537.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p1214">Frisius</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>in omnibus obedire <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>paratissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Ohne Adresse.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
